Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We might be led to believe that God's talent isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I boring you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've said enough about Providence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You need my food, not my words. It speaks too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All this talk of Providence may fill my guests before they eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So now I'll be quiet.
